WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.359 --> 00:00:18.500
What's up everybody!

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.730
So we have reached 100 000 followers

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:23.140
Which is absolutely amazing!

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:24.430
That's a huge milestone for us

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:26.489
And we just want to say thank you so much

00:00:26.489 --> 00:00:28.109
For all your continued support

00:00:28.109 --> 00:00:31.279
You are the reason why we stay motivated to
make these videos.

00:00:31.279 --> 00:00:33.989
Yeah, and to celebrate this milestone

00:00:33.989 --> 00:00:35.890
We have got this crazy challenge

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:37.380
From WhyBotherTry

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:39.559
Who wants us to play a rally

00:00:39.559 --> 00:00:42.090
Using 100 different items.

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:44.240
Let's see if we can do it!

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.400
NO WAY!?

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:56.160
So that was probably one of the hardest things
we have ever done!

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.960
But we probably just broke some sort of a
World Record.

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:03.760
But anyway, once again thank you so much for
all your support

00:05:03.789 --> 00:05:07.319
We are really happy to have every single one
of you watching our videos.

00:05:07.319 --> 00:05:08.780
Y'all are amazing!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:09.499
Until next time!

